# cards: Focus enhanced by Bealzebub. As test_skill_focus, with Jian (level 19, Focus known) wearing Bealzebub (card
# 227, his slot 0x020B46A2) at 1000 points (0x020B489A). The name bar shows the up arrow (fc_list); the cast sets the
# party's sure-hit bit 4 in the battle flags (0x02282940), not Jian's own 0x100; MP 50 -> 44; points 1000 -> 900.
